+# Task 1 review: render-graph history resources + PassSignature bounds check
+
+Commit reviewed: `f9d0554` (base `6b1654a`), branch `main`.
+
+## Spec compliance
+
+| # | Requirement | Verdict | Evidence |
+|---|---|---|---|
